            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Infectious Aura"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(aura, disease)\n\n30 feet. Leukodaemons radiate infection. All creatures within 30 feet of a leukodaemon take a \u20132 status penalty to saves against disease effects. If a creature within range contracts or progresses a disease, all adjacent creatures are exposed to the same disease, at the same DC."
